OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's universities face
OL,4,A'bleak' future as #200m funding gap
OL,5,Arevealed
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's universities face a funding
OL,8,Fgap of about #200m a year, according to
OL,9,Fmajor new report which warns it could
OL,10,Fincrease in the future.
OL,12,FThe picture is "bleak", the report's
OL,13,Fauthor Prof Sir Anton Muscatelli says,
OL,14,Fwith total income no longer enough to
OL,15,Fsustain core activities such as
OL,16,Fteaching and research.
OL,18,FThe report also spotlights the
OL,19,Fincreasing dependence on fee-paying
OL,20,Finternational students to
OL,21,Fcross-subsidise the tuition of Scottish
OL,22,Fundergraduates.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
