OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's universities face
OL,4,A'bleak' future as #200m funding gap
OL,5,Arevealed
OL,6,
OL,7,FUniversities Scotland said the analysis
OL,8,Fmade clear that the current position
OL,9,Fwas not sustainable.
